    "body": "We're very unlikely to do that as no web platform methods are generic right now. Creating that capability would require extensive spec work in Web IDL and extensive implementation work in browsers, for marginal gain. It would also enable authors to create un-idiomatic \"event targets\" that don't extend EventTarget, which isn't a goal.",
